        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aneno i menyirok wor, aka neni, bulir mar'aŋwen, ma bwoko jo, ma ragaŋ, aka tek swa, oyido nitie gi lake ma nyweny aka oyido camo to ŋinyo woko mathindho thindho, ka nyono ŋinjeŋinje gi tiende. Go oyido opokere kwoŋ ogwaŋe m'atelo neno je aka oyido nitie gi tunge apar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.5+REV.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 13:5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo fodi aparo kwoŋ tunge, tungi man mathin owok, aka mafodi k'owoki tunge marapena adek ofudhere gi fuce mere. I tunge mathin me, oyido nitie waŋ jo ma cal waŋ dhano, gi dhok jo ma luwo gigipiny madongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Menyirok pa Ŋatacene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
