          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 1:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka agawo, okethi kombere ma dhum aka Ŋatacene obed'iye, ma law pere oyido tar paka tor, aka yer wiye oyido cal gi pien rombo, kom pere ma dhum oyido cal mac maliel aka tiende oyido cal mac ma waŋo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.5.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 5:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 20:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malawa ma mac otula to mol ruwaŋ go. Ganin gi ganin jotiyo rigo, aka ganin apar jocungo ruwaŋe, oyaw kapido, t'iyawo kitawin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋiyo munyo awinjo derino ma wac ma tungi oluwo, aka paka aŋiyo oneki ogwaŋ t'ibolo delkwoŋe i mac maliel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka ri ogwaŋ m'odoŋ, omay jo woko dhum pajo, to imedo kwo pajo ma hongo gi hongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
