        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An Daniel, cunyan oraman, aka menyirok me ocando paro paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acore cegin gi acel kwoŋ jom'oyido ocungo cegin, t'apenjo go adieri ma gime. Ameno go owaco ran, to miyan ŋeyo dwoŋ ma gigipiny me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogwaŋe madongo aŋwen me jobedo kerin aŋwen ma jolaay i piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jomaleŋ pa Were ma Jamalo Swa jolatero ker, to jodhumo cil gi cil, makicutho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo amito ni aŋey adieri ma mako kwoŋ ogwaŋ mar'aŋwen, m'oyido opokere kwoŋ wadi, ma kelo lworo swa, m'oyido nitie gi lake ma nyweny, gi lwet cinge ma ywel, m'ocamo, oturo mathindho thindho, to nyono ŋinjeŋinje gi tiende; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi tunge aŋwen m'oyido nitie i wic mere, kodi m'owok mathin, rumacen ma tunge adek fudhirok, tunge m'oyido nitie gi waŋe, kodi dhoke m'oluwo gigipiny madongo, ma cal mere oyido loyo wadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 13:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka aŋiyo, tunge me olwenyo gi jomaleŋ to loyo jo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuka Ŋatacene obino, t'ithumo banja ri jomaleŋ pa Jamalo Swa, to hongo tundo ma jomaleŋ jodhumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me gima go owaco: Ogwaŋ mar'aŋwen labedo ker mar'aŋwen i piny, ma lapokere kwoŋ ker je, aka lacamo piny gibe, lanyono piny, to turo mathindho thindho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 17:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunge apar m'owok i ker me obedo kerin apar ma jolaay, aka man laay yuŋey jo, aka go lapokere kwoŋ kerin marapena, aka go ladhumo kerin adek ca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 12:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.5+REV.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go laluwo wac madongo kwoŋ Jamalo Swa, to paro wiro hongo kodi cik; aka ilamiyo i cingi go cuka oro gi oro kodi adec oro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ilayawo kapido t'ithumo banja, aka ilamayo go dhum, ilawaŋo kodi reyo woko kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo ker, dhum kodi dwoŋ ma kerin i pendi polo gibe ilamiyo jomaleŋ pa Jamalo Swa ma ker pere obedo ker ma cil gi cil, aka ker je jolatic rigo kodi winjo go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
